{"id": "37797", "title": "夫妇乐园扎记", "author": "wuwo", "category": "都市言情", "count": 8, "available": 8, "cover": "", "status": "", "source": "files/article/html/37/37797/index.html", "intro": "一年前的一个周末晚上，我第一次带太太到袁夫妇家里玩“夫妇交换”的游戏。袁夫妇住在沙田第一城。袁太太大约三十岁左右，袁先生比她多一两岁。我偶然在杂志上发现袁夫妇登出一段广告，他们徵求夫妇交换或单身男女加入玩性游戏。", "base": "files/article/html/37/37797", "chapters": [{"title": "01", "file": "3012732.html", "available": true}, {"title": "02", "file": "3012734.html", "available": true}, {"title": "03", "file": "5350163.html", "available": true}, {"title": "04", "file": "3012733.html", "available": true}, {"title": "05", "file": "3012735.html", "available": true}, {"title": "06", "file": "5350164.html", "available": true}, {"title": "07", "file": "3012736.html", "available": true}, {"title": "08", "file": "3012737.html", "available": true}]}